            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery disease in identical twins.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>134-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coronary angiography in a pair of identical twins is described. Despite similarities in coronary risk factors, major differences were seen in both the anatomy and the degree of coronary disease.</AbstractText>
